# Single source of truth for pinned tool versions LOCAL to this package.
# Sourced by the scripts that need them — bump in ONE place, never inline.

# pana — pub.dev's own analyzer, run by the `platforms` make target to gate
# that the package still resolves to every expected pub.dev platform. `dart
# pub global activate` resolves it from pub.dev (own integrity), so no sha is
# tracked. Keep at pub.dev's LATEST: the gate must run the same pana pub.dev
# runs, or it drifts from the verdict it exists to predict.
PANA_VERSION="0.23.19"
